    "rankMathHead": "<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Anxiety is not always a response to something going wrong right now. Understanding why you feel anxious when everything seems fine can be a meaningful first step.\"/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large\"/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Why Do I Feel Anxious Even When Everything Seems Fine? · ChangeMoment\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Anxiety is not always a response to something going wrong right now. Understanding why you feel anxious when everything seems fine can be a meaningful first step.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ChangeMoment Mental Health Centre\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Anxiety\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Counselling\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Emotional Wellbeing\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Mental Health\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Uncertainty\" />\n<meta property=\"article:tag\" content=\"Worry\" />\n<meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"Uncategorized\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Why Do I Feel Anxious Even When Everything Seems Fine? · ChangeMoment\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Anxiety is not always a response to something going wrong right now. Understanding why you feel anxious when everything seems fine can be a meaningful first step.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Time to read\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"6 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"rank-math-schema\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":[\"Person\",\"Organization\"],\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/#person\",\"name\":\"ChangeMoment Mental Health Centre\"},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/#website\",\"url\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms\",\"name\":\"ChangeMoment Mental Health Centre\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/#person\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry\",\"name\":\"Why Do I Feel Anxious Even When Everything Seems Fine? \\u00b7 ChangeMoment\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/#website\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/author/\",\"url\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/author/\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"@id\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/?s=96&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\",\"url\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/?s=96&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}},{\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Why Do I Feel Anxious Even When Everything Seems Fine? \\u00b7 ChangeMoment\",\"keywords\":\"Anxiety, Mental Health, Counselling, Worry, Uncertainty\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-12T12:00:00+00:00\",\"articleSection\":\"Uncategorized\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/author/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/cms/#person\"},\"description\":\"Anxiety is not always a response to something going wrong right now. Understanding why you feel anxious when everything seems fine can be a meaningful first step.\",\"name\":\"Why Do I Feel Anxious Even When Everything Seems Fine? \\u00b7 ChangeMoment\",\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry#richSnippet\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry#webpage\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://changemoment.ca/blogs/anxiety-beyond-worry#webpage\"}}]}</script>\n"
